WEBVTT

00:01:59.407 --> 00:02:02.577
that was significant or important.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:04.662
I was really struggling.

00:02:05.121 --> 00:02:08.040
I thought I had a pretty good idea
of what success looked like

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.959
in a working career,

00:02:09.959 --> 00:02:13.963
but when it came to retirement,
it was fuzzier for me.

00:02:14.672 --> 00:02:17.049
So I decided to dig deeper.

00:02:17.091 --> 00:02:21.220
And what I discovered was that much
of the material on retirement

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:25.600
focuses on the financial
and/or the estate side of things.

00:02:25.641 --> 00:02:27.977
And of course, they're both important,

00:02:28.019 --> 00:02:30.396
but just not what I was looking for.